{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/perf/bundle-budget.json","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-11-04T21:36:44.673640Z","id":"ced24034a3a3e3254d111479d2af6b9ca137c2f5f92421bbc68e30a398e7be4d","body":{"detail":"Measured by bazel test //web:bundle_size before the raise: artifact 70725 and extWorker 25512 gzip bytes. extWorker grew for web/extension/src/sw/pairing.ts (askNative over a connectNative port, and the held confirmation ID kept in session storage) and the open.confirmation handler in web/extension/src/sw/background.ts. artifact grew because every page's confirmation toasts (web/shell/src/q/ConfirmToasts.svelte) carry ConfirmationCard and PasskeySetup, which now answer a held passkey registration on the setup line (web/shell/src/q/PasskeySetup.svelte, cardsOf and carriesSetup in web/shell/src/q/confirm.svelte.ts).","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":4},"end":{"line":16},"content_hash":"f124b8f7c3ac5f89c908eb3552f42f7c2aee66237814074050bd32522ab8d4eb"},"suggested_fix":"Keep the raise, or ask for the bytes back: loading PasskeySetup lazily from ConfirmationCard would take the setup line out of the artifact entry.","summary":"The artifact and extWorker budgets were raised by hand for held pairing and passkey confirmations (artifact 70656 to 70752, extWorker 25216 to 25536)","tags":["status:needs-decision","perf","session:claude-code:e918cd68-4487-4c95-bd23-c79e5ca5d3e5"]}}
