{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/perf/bundle-budget.json","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-11-13T14:42:25.137523Z","id":"f5db4888b94f2425f1c7f884bd1e81b9bcc92a1e60b1fb08226dbf3bede0f43a","body":{"detail":"bazelisk test //web:bundle_size at 28679be1c measures gallery 33093 and artifact 71388 gzip bytes. The whole rise is the --band custom property in the three theme blocks of web/shell/src/theme.css (lines 22, 60, 78), which both entries inline: about 15 bytes each, measured by gzipping the built artifact.html and index.html with and without the declarations. Nothing else of the timeline is in either entry's closure. Keep the raise, or drop --band for --border-strong at reduced opacity (the other option web/shell/src/theme.css's band rule could take).","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":3},"end":{"line":4},"content_hash":"fb1a7b24dd43483986942f974a1cc3ee5e750fae6c35e77088a5ac600429e9ad"},"summary":"The gallery and artifact budgets were raised by hand for the timeline's --band token (gallery 33079 to 33093, artifact 71373 to 71388)","tags":["status:needs-decision","session:claude-code:ed7d5258-2c86-46a9-8e5a-cd958e24dd71"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/perf/bundle-budget.json","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-11-13T14:42:25.137567Z","id":"cffd2f278f33887791a520b5d09770dc7324d6b5ea986496b4b69c1d822fec73","body":{"detail":"Measured with bazelisk test //web:bundle_size before and after 28679be1c and compared file by file: sidepanel.js +353 (Sidebar.svelte: the {#if view}{#await import(\"./SidebarViews.svelte\")} branch with its fifteen props, the card snippet's timeline form and the sections and empty snippets it hands over), the shared theme stylesheet +15 (--band). Two cheaper-looking forms cost more and were not kept: passing Sidebar's whole props object (sidebar={p}) pulls Svelte's rest_props into the shared props chunk (+167 to the artifact entry), and a destructuring {#each} pulls to_array into the chunk every entry shares. Smaller still would need the tabs outside SidebarViews.svelte or the props folded into the view object ShellSidebar.svelte passes.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":18},"end":{"line":18},"content_hash":"bba27ecb5f1319da2af32bd259747e5f7245ba1bf7c1bc3fdbd2e87c31338ae2"},"summary":"extPanel grew 368 gzip bytes (64356 to 64724) with the sidebar's views, not the few bytes the timeline's design allowed; its 66560 budget is unchanged","tags":["status:needs-decision","session:claude-code:ed7d5258-2c86-46a9-8e5a-cd958e24dd71"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/perf/bundle-budget.json","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-11-13T15:46:20.955583Z","id":"868a7dc1a6b73c9e0238c1966bb881d7947e88707f4cbd4c2131d7f109dfaf55","body":{"detail":"just web-test (//web:bundle_size) measures artifact 71628, gallery 33087 (budget 33093, down 6), panel 64722 (+2). The bytes are the island's part of the strip, which must be eager so the frame is laid out once: the railShows condition (web/shell/src/ui/sidebar-chunk.ts), the (min-width: 701px) media query followed live, the empty aside.rail placeholder and its box rules (web/shell/src/ui/SidebarIsland.svelte). The strip's drawing comes in the sidebar's lazy chunk. Two ways tried and dropped as costlier: a separate ShellRail chunk with its own loader (+451, the preload list of its dependencies), and {#each}/{#if} inside the strip's SVG or an SVG-namespaced component (+120 to every entry, the runtime's SVG template code landing in the shared chunk). The views prefetch at git:d89b4f190 costs 0. Still needs-decision: keep the raise.","kind":"comment","references":"f5db4888b94f2425f1c7f884bd1e81b9bcc92a1e60b1fb08226dbf3bede0f43a","summary":"Raised again, artifact 71388 to 71628 (+240 gzip bytes), for the collapsed sidebar strip at git:c4bd55e87","tags":["status:needs-decision","session:claude-code:ed7d5258-2c86-46a9-8e5a-cd958e24dd71"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/perf/bundle-budget.json","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-11-13T15:58:41.985184Z","id":"110016c024186931c32cfb74a0e7128524ad69217ed2f166ad5ae8b3321a7d9d","body":{"detail":"//web:bundle_size (just web-test) measures artifact 71629: the strip's empty box in web/shell/src/ui/SidebarIsland.svelte gained aria-label=\"Comment threads\", as the drawer's empty box has. gallery 33087, panel 64722 unchanged. Still needs-decision: keep the raise.","kind":"comment","references":"f5db4888b94f2425f1c7f884bd1e81b9bcc92a1e60b1fb08226dbf3bede0f43a","summary":"Raised again, artifact 71628 to 71629 (+1 gzip byte), at git:3ab1cae7e","tags":["status:needs-decision","session:claude-code:ed7d5258-2c86-46a9-8e5a-cd958e24dd71"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/perf/bundle-budget.json","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-11-13T16:12:04.518569Z","id":"85976fd9034fce010aa0c9b342b94e269da949bd00fd436516c8ff730633f4fd","body":{"detail":"just web-test, //web:bundle_size: 'extension: ... panel 64722', 'artifact 71629'. The end-to-end spec and its docs added nothing to either entry.","kind":"comment","references":"cffd2f278f33887791a520b5d09770dc7324d6b5ea986496b4b69c1d822fec73","summary":"At 0dc6d8c5e the extension's panel measures 64722 gzip bytes and the artifact entry 71629","tags":["session:claude-code:ed7d5258-2c86-46a9-8e5a-cd958e24dd71"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/perf/bundle-budget.json","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-11-13T17:02:41.336174Z","id":"1749c5ed4c91c04d9834427db8dbd495f35410a4a32fbb3c99d01cbcd0e0e15c","body":{"kind":"comment","references":"cffd2f278f33887791a520b5d09770dc7324d6b5ea986496b4b69c1d822fec73","summary":"The seven fix(shell) commits that follow 232cd0f15 on the timeline (its review findings) move extPanel from 64722 to 64742 gzip bytes (+20), within its unchanged 66560 budget; just web-test (//web:bundle_size) measures it. The panel carries SidebarViews.svelte and Timeline.svelte through its build. The note for comments off is passed to SidebarViews as a string (web/shell/src/ui/Sidebar.svelte:311): passed as a snippet it cost the panel +57.","tags":["session:claude-code:ed7d5258-2c86-46a9-8e5a-cd958e24dd71"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/perf/bundle-budget.json","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-11-15T08:00:29.886604Z","id":"209f8ee847cdd9901871983d868ba09d7b996ef93ebfaa020da9095a5c53bf2b","body":{"detail":"The cost is the draft keeping in web/shell/src/ui/Sidebar.svelte (`drafts`, `replyBox`, `replyText`, `replied` and the card's three props), which the extension's side panel carries because it imports Sidebar.svelte statically, though it passes no view and so never keeps a draft; and ThreadCard.svelte's `draft` prop. Measured with bazelisk test //web:bundle_size at that commit and at the branch's last. Moving the keeping into the shell's chunk (for example as part of the `view` prop that ShellSidebar.svelte passes, from web/shell/src/ui/sidebar-view.svelte.ts) would take most of it out of the panel, at the cost of the drafts no longer living in Sidebar.svelte's module state beside `unfolded`.","kind":"comment","references":"cffd2f278f33887791a520b5d09770dc7324d6b5ea986496b4b69c1d822fec73","summary":"The reply drafts that survive a tab switch (commit 'fix(shell): a reply draft survives a switch between the Timeline and Threads tabs') move extPanel from 64739 to 64896 gzip bytes (+157); with the commits after it, 64897. Budget 66560 unchanged; artifact stays at 71629 and gallery at 33087","tags":["timeline-sidebar","bundle-budget","status:needs-decision","session:claude-code:ed7d5258-2c86-46a9-8e5a-cd958e24dd71"]}}
