{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/perf/bundle-budget.json","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-11-13T19:43:07.081228Z","id":"f27a2619d845eabaca54acb42464eea04d711bd38ea4abb3b2a7d191164f01f5","body":{"detail":"Measured by bazelisk test //web:bundle_size: 49291 bytes. Where it went, from the 45056 budget (44586 measured at the branch's first smooth-load commit): the page's HTML carries the skeleton's every part (both groups' cards in a card's rows), the inline clax-shape script and its CSS (about 1.9 KB gzip); ClaxBot's meter now renders in the header from the first render (web/shell/src/ui/BotMeter.svelte with web/shell/src/bot/meter.ts, 848 bytes, split out of bot/model.ts, whose whole 4343-byte chunk the entry first pulled in); the gallery's failure messages, the banner's wait and keeping the page's shape (view/gallery-shape.ts). Taken back: the usage banner (web/shell/src/bot/UsageBanner.svelte, 1132 bytes) loads as its own chunk only when a banner shows, the content's first render waiting for it; HeaderBot's chunk is gone from the lazy module. Kept in the entry: Roster and working-model (about 3.5 KB), see the alternative on web/shell/src/ui/Gallery.svelte:83.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":3},"end":{"line":3},"content_hash":"adb1e079753a472baefb1a58ecc7413282f74b7644baa189a9e2011732069a74"},"summary":"The gallery entry's budget rose from 45056 to 49408 gzip bytes for the shaped skeleton, ClaxBot's meter in the header and the failure and shape-keeping paths","tags":["bundle-size","session:claude-code:b9f94772-0463-4668-a532-bfded61f18de"]}}
