{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/perf/bundle-budget.json","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-11-19T22:56:16.502629Z","id":"d014f8b9205a8758714bdf8cbd6e89aafda11f2b9404db1ae4efa62624a3ccee","body":{"detail":"bazelisk test //web:bundle_size measured artifact 71821 gzip bytes (71743 before, exactly at its budget). The 78 bytes are the eager part of the Analytics panel: web/shell/src/ui/TopbarIsland.svelte's lazy import of AnalyticsPanel.svelte while the artifact carries analytics and the more menu's onAnalytics prop, the opener state in web/shell/src/ui/more-menu.svelte.ts (analyticsOpen, setAnalyticsOpener), and the exports the panel's chunk imports from the entry. Drawing the chart with {@html} cost the gallery +110 (Svelte's html block split out of the gallery's entry into a chunk of its own); the panel sets the chart's markup through an attachment instead, and the gallery is unchanged at 49348. Keep the raise, or ask for the bytes back.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":4},"end":{"line":4},"content_hash":"19fff9916eae2780267a1d3b9214a6eda04ca5bd4f92b6161f0916f0ea287c95"},"summary":"The artifact budget was raised by hand to the measured size for the Analytics panel's entry (artifact 71743 to 71821)","tags":["bundle","status:needs-decision","session:claude-code:b9f94772-0463-4668-a532-bfded61f18de"]}}
