{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/perf/bundle-budget.json","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-11-19T23:22:32.503479Z","id":"1ea9903be3f2aa9a61dbb06dd289efcd71470c4d013fa1b1a2a3b7b829803c6d","body":{"detail":"bazelisk test //web:bundle_size measured artifact 71240 and eager bridge 6281 at the parent of e1b43102d, and 71908 and 6732 after it: the bridge's securitypolicyviolation listener, lockdown check and log (web/bridge/src/blocked.ts, ~1 KB raw, its patterns compressing poorly), and in the artifact entry the clax:blocked check, the controller's state and the stage's lazy notice loader. Whether the raise stands, or the bridge's filtering moves to a lazy part with only a raw buffer kept eagerly, is the owner's call. At 2b2257293, on site-own-policy after the Content Security Policy rename, it measures artifact 71743 (main's budget is 71629) and eager bridge 6732 (main's is 6288); web/perf/bundle-budget.json holds those.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":4},"end":{"line":7},"content_hash":"82653ea171772cf148b94d1b24292d15eb45c3de7a42130496ec53fae382ab09"},"summary":"The artifact and eager bridge budgets were raised by hand to the measured sizes for the blocked notice (artifact 71373 to 71908, bridge 6288 to 6732)","supersedes":"5b522215882f281d355625c29c1254a9e243448cc23e01c7f9114422fee59a98","tags":["bundle-size","status:needs-decision","session:claude-code:b9f94772-0463-4668-a532-bfded61f18de"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/perf/bundle-budget.json","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-11-20T15:40:11.901390Z","id":"bfc64521ece8acbf8a4b0faa241ba18991cdef472b4e5027f0dd27c4019170ef","body":{"detail":"bazelisk test //web:bundle_size measured artifact 71938 gzip bytes on feat/site-analytics rebased onto main bb8fd3a45, whose budget was 71828: 110 more for the top bar's lazy import of ui/AnalyticsPanel.svelte, the more menu's Analytics item and its opener (web/shell/src/ui/TopbarIsland.svelte, MoreMenu.svelte, more-menu.svelte.ts). Before main's top bar change (#118) the same code measured 78 more (71743 to 71821). The new analytics chunk measures 7431 against its ceiling of 7488. Whether the raise stands is the owner's call.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":4},"end":{"line":4},"content_hash":"94665d6b9a820131e5d352f50f88849ce1b7ac7f00de5b1e6cd11c6edc25f8f9"},"summary":"The artifact budget was raised by hand to the measured size for the Analytics panel's entry (artifact 71828 to 71938)","supersedes":"d014f8b9205a8758714bdf8cbd6e89aafda11f2b9404db1ae4efa62624a3ccee","tags":["bundle-size","status:needs-decision","session:claude-code:b9f94772-0463-4668-a532-bfded61f18de"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/perf/bundle-budget.json","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-11-17T22:35:02.651609Z","id":"58d7cddc8b38fd12c5d1bbf1749181022e24f045c901c47625997c597b49225b","body":{"detail":"Measured by //web:bundle_size at each commit of branch fix/shell-says-when-it-cannot-reach. The eager part is web/shell/src/trouble.ts (ApiError, readError, readJson, classify, reasonText), web/shell/src/reach.ts (the request hook's notice, its /healthz probe and loadWait), the kinds' words in web/shell/src/conn-notice.ts, and the hook in web/shell/src/owner-proof.ts; it must be eager because a lazy chunk does not load from a Clax that is gone. Removing the duplicate error parsers (api.ts json, threads.ts ok, held.ts, q/api.ts, ui/clone-api.ts, ui/publish-api.ts, view/tags-api.ts, caps/approval.ts, ui/PermissionsPanel.svelte) paid for part of it. extWorker carries the stream hub's whyDown and its status why (web/shell/src/stream-hub.ts). Keep the raise, or ask for the bytes back (for example by loading reach.ts's probe after the first paint).","kind":"comment","references":"f5db4888b94f2425f1c7f884bd1e81b9bcc92a1e60b1fb08226dbf3bede0f43a","summary":"Raised again for the shell telling the person when Clax cannot be reached: gallery 33093 to 34419, artifact 71629 to 72929, extWorker 25544 to 25748 gzip bytes","tags":["status:needs-decision","session:claude-code:ed7d5258-2c86-46a9-8e5a-cd958e24dd71"]}}
