{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/perf/bundle-budget.json","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-11-25T03:12:19.873374Z","id":"388873e088e58040f63125a4f7d733f30fe3c5b9e123b905e7e3837bbb29fa34","body":{"detail":"Measured by bazel test //web:bundle_size: gallery 51092, artifact 73642, queues 26129 gzip bytes. Already trimmed: the request's line is web/shell/src/q/queue-request-line.ts (no imports), the Queues page lists requests through web/shell/src/queues/api.ts listPendingQueueRequests and loads QueueRequestCard with a dynamic import. What remains is the inbox's queue_request card wiring (web/shell/src/q/InboxPage.svelte, inbox-model.ts) and the Queues page's Requests section. Options: keep the raise; or load the inbox's QueueRequestCard lazily too.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":3},"end":{"line":20},"content_hash":"4dc16c263a19ab60d9e1a99aed40aef890a7ddf8f88a743b0609255e97a75549"},"summary":"The gallery, artifact and queues budgets were raised by hand for queue requests (gallery 51064 to 51104, artifact 73564 to 73664, queues 25216 to 26176)","tags":["perf","status:needs-decision","session:claude-code:81ed4f00-a75f-41f2-a558-eb649b5b9f3d"]}}
